{"speciesId":192,"names":{"fr":"Héliatronc","es":"Sunflora","en":"Sunflora","ja":"キマワリ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It converts sun­ light into energy. In the darkness after sunset, it closes its petals and becomes still."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"In the daytime, it rushes about in a hectic manner, but it comes to a com­ plete stop when the sun sets."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"As the hot season approaches, the petals on this POKéMON's face become more vivid and lively."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SUNFLORA converts solar energy into nutrition. It moves around actively in the daytime when it is warm. It stops moving as soon as the sun goes down for the night."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SUNFLORA converts solar energy into nutrition. It moves around actively in the daytime when it is warm. It stops moving as soon as the sun goes down for the night."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"SUNFLORA convert solar energy into nutrition. They are highly active in the warm daytime but suddenly stop moving as soon as the sun sets."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"In the daytime, it rushes about in a hectic manner, but it comes to a complete stop when the sun sets."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It converts sunlight into energy. In the darkness after sunset, it closes its petals and becomes still."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It gets energy from warm sunlight and is known for its habit of moving in pursuit of it."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It gets energy from warm sunlight and is known for its habit of moving in pursuit of it."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It gets energy from warm sunlight and is known for its habit of moving in pursuit of it."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It converts sunlight into energy. In the darkness after sunset, it closes its petals and b